{"id":"06953a4e0f3fa506","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-division-algebra.md","title":"Division Algebra","display":"df-division-algebra — Division Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-division-algebra","aliases":["58-df-division-algebra"],"display":"df-division-algebra — Division Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-division-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-division-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-division-algebra — Division Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-algebra.md\">../batch19/58-df-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A\\in V\">\\(K,A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A\\in V\\)</span> (algebra data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-algebra.md\">../batch19/58-df-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DivisionAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{DivisionAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (division-algebra predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}division\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DivisionAlgebra}_S(K,A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Alg}_S(K,A,+,\\cdot)\\land0_A,1_A\\in A\\land0_A\\ne1_A\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(0_A+a=a=a+0_A)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\setminus\\{0_A\\}\\;\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=1_A\\land b\\cdot a=1_A)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}division\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DivisionAlgebra}_S(K,A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Alg}_S(K,A,+,\\cdot)\\land0_A,1_A\\in A\\land0_A\\ne1_A\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(0_A+a=a=a+0_A)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\setminus\\{0_A\\}\\;\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=1_A\\land b\\cdot a=1_A)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every nonzero element of a division algebra is invertible.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_A\">\\(0_A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_A\">\\(1_A\\)</span> 分别由给定加法和乘法的双侧单位律固定，避免把任意非单位元素误当作零元。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_S$ ($K$-algebra predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_S","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DivisionAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}division\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DivisionAlgebra}_S(K,A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Alg}_S(K,A,+,\\cdot)\\land0_A,1_A\\in A\\land0_A\\ne1_A\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(0_A+a=a=a+0_A)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\setminus\\{0_A\\}\\;\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=1_A\\land b\\cdot a=1_A)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"0_A","display":false},{"tex":"1_A","display":false}],"bytes":1077,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-448","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-division-algebra.md|58-df-division-algebra]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["573b416d39297a97"]}